  0 0 M PFa 5 get rotate PFs -2 div dup translate
  0 1 PFs PFa 4 get div 1 add floor cvi
	{PFa 4 get mul 0 M 0 PFs V} for
  0 PFa 6 get ne {
	0 1 PFs PFa 4 get div 1 add floor cvi
	{PFa 4 get mul 0 2 1 roll M PFs 0 V} for
 } if
  stroke grestore} def
